    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d65bb679758b85df06c924",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从目白麦昆赢得“菊花赏”的那天开始，\n目白家的赛马娘到目前为止\n还无人能赢得下一场经典级GⅠ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de9f9695daf86d5acd865ff38839d693aed869fde35586e02cfaa7f5428d07ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
